COMPILATION OF: E48A4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A4

   1 a 0000 E48A4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] `b = '1'b' AND `b = '0'b' AS CONDITIONS, in one
   4 a 0006      object, on a STATIC bit.  E11D pins the ANI/SUI ladder
   5 a 0006      outside a loop; the skip byte it pins is JNZ, which is not
   6 a 0006      what a bare-bit test uses.  This row decides whether the
   7 a 0006      ladder keeps JNZ here. */
   8 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   9 c 0006   if b = '1'b then
  10 c 0010      put list('ONE');
  11 c 0027   if b = '0'b then
  12 c 002F      put list('ZERO');
  13 c 0046   stop;
  14 a 0049 end E48A4;

CODE SIZE = 0049
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 3890
END  COMPILATION
